message: "If you use this model or code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Rab35/LAMP-2A Synergy in LRRK2 G2019S Parkinson's Disease: A Mechanistic, Identifiability-Constrained Model"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sahay"
    given-names: "Risha"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sahayrisha/lrrk2-multiscale-model"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23201680"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-06"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Parkinson's disease
  - LRRK2
  - computational biology
  - systems biology
  - alpha-synuclein
  - mechanistic modeling
abstract: >-
  A multiscale, identifiability-constrained computational model testing
  whether combined Rab35 pathway blockade and LAMP-2A overexpression act
  synergistically to reduce pathological alpha-synuclein secretion in
  LRRK2 G2019S Parkinson's disease neurons. Calibrated against literature
  biomarker ratios, validated against independent held-out experimental
  data, and uncertainty-quantified via profile likelihood and ensemble
  sampling.